"\n"
"Automatically fills the bank name, BIC/SWIFT and country on bank\n"
"accounts from their IBAN using the bank registry provided by schwifty.\n"
"\n"
"In Odoo 20, these details are stored directly on the bank account; there\n"
"is no separate bank record. Explicit values supplied when creating or\n"
"updating an account are preserved.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"No bank directory configuration is required. Bank details are obtained\n"
"from the schwifty registry.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Open a contact and its bank accounts.\n"
"2. Create or edit an account and enter an IBAN.\n"
"3. The bank name, BIC/SWIFT and country are filled automatically.\n"
"\n"
"This also applies when creating or updating accounts through imports or\n"
"the API, and when using the manual bank setup wizard. If a valid IBAN\n"
"has no bank in the registry, only its country can be identified.\n"
"\n"
